{
  "slug": "cellcog",
  "name": "Cellcog",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Any-to-any AI sub-agent — generate images, videos, PDFs, presentations, research reports, music, spreadsheets, 3D models, memes, diagrams, prototypes, game assets, and stickers from natural language prompts. CellCog orchestrates 21+ foundation models so you can produce rich media deliverables without leaving your IDE. Ships with 16 skills, an auto-routing rule, and a setup command. #1 on the DeepResearch Bench.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `3d-model-generation-cellcog` (AI 3D model generation powered by CellCog), `audio-generation-cellcog` (AI audio generation and text-to-speech powered by CellCog), `cellcog` (Any-to-any AI sub-agent — research, images, video, audio, music, podcasts, avatars, voice cloning, documents, spreadsheets, dashboards, 3D models,…), `data-analysis-cellcog` (AI data analysis and visualization powered by CellCog), `deep-research-cellcog` (AI deep research powered by CellCog), `diagram-flowchart-cellcog` (AI diagram and flowchart generation powered by CellCog), `excel-spreadsheet-cellcog` (AI Excel spreadsheet generation powered by CellCog), `game-asset-generation-cellcog` (AI game asset generation and game development powered by CellCog), and 8 more\n- **Commands** (1): `cellcog-setup` (Set up the CellCog Python SDK (install and authenticate))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cellcog@claude-community` from `CellCog/cellcog-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
